  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-14",
  "historyNote": "#10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.12) New. #10757, eff 1-8-15 (from Puc 902.15); ss by, eff 9-14-20 (formerly Puc 902.16)",
